\section{Concurrent Optimization}\label{sec:txn-concurrent}

\subsection{Parallelizing the Optimization Pipeline}\label{sec:txn-parallel}

Traditional compiler optimization pipelines execute passes sequentially.
Transactional transformations enable \emph{concurrent optimization}: running
multiple passes in parallel on different parts of the program.

